<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's CPI drops 0.2 pct in June from May.</title>
<headline>Morocco's CPI drops 0.2 pct in June from May.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Statistics Directorate issued on Monday the following economic indicators:</p>
<p>    MOROCCO'S CONSUMER PRICES :    JUNE 97    MAY 97</p>
<p>    Month/month change (pct)	   - 0.2	-0.67</p>
<p>    Year/year change		     +0.14	- 0.8</p>
<p>Base:100 points - 1989</p>
<p>The slight drop for June could be attributed to a decrease in food costs, the directorate said.</p>
</text>
